  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Son, when you''re really worried, you often withdraw into yourself and
    literally close your eyes to everything around you. The doctor said it''s normal
    - your mind is trying to rest and cope with the stress.

    If you get confused
    or can''t find something while I''m not home, just sit down, close your eyes,
    and try to concentrate.

    Your memory works much better when you''re alone.
    Just turn to the walls with your eyes closed, and everything will become clearer.

    If
    you''re scared, call your aunt at +1 (415) 555-0143'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
