  m_text: My mother was screaming that she couldn't live like this anymore, and my
    father, who had been standing quietly, suddenly grabbed a <s><b>knife</b></s>,
    but it wasn't there. I had hidden them all. My mother then yelled at me to put
    everything back in its place.
